---
title: "syncRoles (stem-bot-v2: src/api/rolesSync.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: discord_uid = req.body.discord_uid
    q_validate --> q_400: !discord_uid
    q_validate --> q_get_member: discord_uid provided
    q_400 --> [*]: res.status(400)
    q_get_member --> q_404_discord: member = null (getMember)
    q_get_member --> q_fetch_db: member found
    q_404_discord --> [*]: res.status(404) "Discord member not found"
    q_fetch_db --> q_404_db: memberData = null (supabase query)
    q_fetch_db --> q_sync_gen: memberData found
    q_404_db --> [*]: res.status(404) "Member not found in database"
    q_sync_gen --> q_sync_teams: sync generation roles (add correct, remove others)
    q_sync_teams --> q_sync_leader: sync team roles (add member teams, remove non-member teams)
    q_sync_leader --> q_sync_status: sync leader role based on team_leaders table
    q_sync_status --> q_sync_member_role: sync status roles (JH/H/OB based on member.status)
    q_sync_member_role --> q_sync_verified: sync member role (active only, remove for OB)
    q_sync_verified --> q_respond: sync verified role (always add if registered)
    q_respond --> [*]: res.json(success, roles_assigned, roles_removed)

    note right of q_sync_gen
        INV-001: Only one generation role per member at any time
        INV-002: Team roles reflect current member_team_relations
        INV-003: Leader role iff member_id in team_leaders
        INV-004: Status roles are mutually exclusive (0=JH, 1=H, 2=OB)
        INV-005: Member role granted only for status 0 or 1
        INV-006: Verified role granted to all DB-registered members
        INV-007: discord_uid from request body is trusted without validation against auth token
    end note
